# The Vercel CLI uploads the whole working tree and does NOT read .gitignore,
# so this is an allowlist, not a denylist: ignore everything at the root, then
# re-admit only what a deploy needs. Without this, `vercel` would try to upload
# the ~4GB build/ tree (build/ios alone is 2.6GB).
#
# Anything new that Vercel must serve has to be re-admitted here with `!`.
/*
!api
!build
!vercel.json

# Narrow build/ to just the Flutter web output.
build/*
!build/web
